meta {
  name: Get All Inventory
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/inventory
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{token}}
}

docs {
  # Get All Inventory

  This request is used to get all inventory data. This request interacts with the MySQL database, has protected routes, and has a pagination.

  ## Responses

  **200 — Inventory fetched successfully.** Ordered in descending order by `is_favorite`
```json
  {
    "status": "success",
    "message": "inventory fetched",
    "lend_data": [
      {
        "inventory_category": "Food & Beverages",
        "list_inventory": "Nike Air Force 1 High By You"
      }
    ],
    "data": {
      "data": [
        {
          "id": "6f59235e-c398-8a83-2f95-3f1fbe95ca6e",
          "inventory_name": "Nike Air Force 1 High By You",
          "inventory_category": "Fashion",
          "inventory_desc": "Sepatu High",
          "inventory_merk": "Nike",
          "inventory_room": "Main Room",
          "inventory_storage": "Wardrobe",
          "inventory_rack": "Shoes & Sandals - Bottom",
          "inventory_price": 2249000,
          "inventory_image": "https://example.com/inventory/image.jpg",
          "inventory_unit": "Pcs",
          "inventory_vol": 1,
          "inventory_capacity_unit": "percentage",
          "inventory_capacity_vol": 80,
          "inventory_color": "Black",
          "is_favorite": 1,
          "is_reminder": 0,
          "created_at": "2024-03-19 02:37:58",
          "created_by": "2d98f524-de02-11ed-b5ea-0242ac120002",
          "updated_at": "2024-07-18 15:50:18",
          "deleted_at": "2024-05-02 03:32:31"
        }
      ]
    }
  }
```

  **401 — protected route need to include sign in token as authorization bearer**
```json
  {
    "status": "failed",
    "message": "you need to include the authorization token from login"
  }
```

  **404 — inventory failed to fetched**
```json
  {
    "status": "failed",
    "message": "inventory not found"
  }
```

  **500 — Internal Server Error**
```json
  {
    "status": "error",
    "message": "something wrong. please contact admin"
  }
```
}